Hi Finn, Alex and Oliver,

Following our email last night, could you please confirm that today's final t=
esting at 10:30 UK time still works for you? A quick reply to this email, or =
accepting the attached calendar invite, is all we need.

If today does not suit, just reply with a time that works better and we will =
